# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI Smart Paste / Search (OPTIONAL). Downloading works without any key.
# With a key, you can type a song name and get the best results to download.
#
# Add ONE (or both) — Groq is used first because it's fastest, then Gemini.
# Copy this file to ".env" and put your REAL keys there (".env" is gitignored).
# Do NOT put real keys in this example file — it is committed to git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Groq (fast, free tier): https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=""

# Google Gemini (free tier): https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=""

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LOGIN COOKIES (OPTIONAL) — needed for Instagram, Facebook, private/age-gated
# posts. These sites block anonymous downloads, so yt-dlp must reuse your logged-in
# browser session.
#
# Easiest: set the browser you're logged in with (must be logged in to the site):
#   chrome | safari | brave | edge | firefox | chromium | opera | vivaldi
# COOKIES_FROM_BROWSER="chrome"
#
# (Safari/Chrome on macOS may prompt once for Keychain access — click Allow.)
#
# Alternative: export a cookies.txt (via a "Get cookies.txt" browser extension)
# and point to it — or just drop a cookies.txt in the project root (auto-used).
# COOKIES_FILE="/absolute/path/to/cookies.txt"
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
COOKIES_FROM_BROWSER=""
